OL,3,GNEWSAArsonist jailed after he set fire
OL,4,Ato multiple cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn arsonist who set fire to six cars,
OL,7,FChristmas decorations and electricity
OL,8,Fcabling in Hucknall has been jailed.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said it received
OL,11,Fan abandoned call, believed to be from
OL,12,FScott Knight, claiming he had been
OL,13,Fkidnapped and stabbed on 4 January.
OL,15,FWhen officers responded to the call in
OL,16,FPoppy Close, they spotted smoke coming
OL,17,Ffrom the direction of nearby Nottingham
OL,18,FRoad and found multiple cars on fire.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
