OL,3,GNEWSAArsonist jailed after he set fire
OL,4,Ato multiple cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnight, 38, was arrested and pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty to six counts of arson with
OL,8,Frecklessness as to whether life was
OL,9,Fendangered and one count of arson. He
OL,10,Fwas sentenced to six years in prison
OL,11,Fand three years on licence on Friday at
OL,12,FNottingham Crown Court.
